Project Name: SocialEx – Redefining Social Connectivity
Maximum Marks: 2 Marks

Customer Problem Statement Template
To define the core problems users face while using existing social media platforms, and use those insights to guide the development of SocialEx, a next-generation social media app with real-time messaging, post saving, story sharing, and robust privacy features.

Problem Statement (PS)
Problem Statement	I am (Customer)	I’m trying to	But	Because	Which makes me feel
PS-1	a student working on a group project	collaborate effectively with my team online	existing platforms lack real-time educational collaboration features	they are designed for casual use, not productivity or structured teamwork	frustrated and limited in productivity
PS-2	a social media user who values privacy	share posts, messages, and media securely	I don’t trust existing platforms with my private data	many platforms have weak privacy policies and history of data breaches	anxious and hesitant to express freely
PS-3	a content explorer	save and organize content for future use or team sharing	current platforms don’t offer seamless post saving or referencing	content gets buried or lost in feeds quickly	disorganized and overwhelmed
PS-4	a creator or community builder	engage followers through rich media like stories, posts, and chat	current engagement tools are disconnected or delayed	real-time features are not well integrated	uninspired and disconnected from my audience
